 possible combination pairs. Display also the total number of combinations.</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Follow the test output display format.</span></font><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 16px;=\"\" white-space:=\"\" normal;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Test Input</span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">\n</span></u></span><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Oliver Kelly Joe Luke</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Oliver Kelly Joe Luke Jayce Smith</span></font></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 16px;=\"\" white-space:=\"\" normal;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Test Output (</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">Red Text - User Input</span></u><span segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";\"=\"\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><u>)\n</u></span></font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Test your program with the examples below:\nYour display order 